# ripgrep-only: keeps the archives out of Claude's default Grep/Glob results.
# An explicit-path search (Grep path=docs/plans/archive) still reaches it.
# git and Bash grep (ugrep) do not read this file.
# Never use a permissions.deny Read() rule for this: it also blocks Bash
# (ls/cat) and explicit-path Grep, so a task that must touch the archive
# burns retries on denials.
docs/plans/archive/
